  "content": "<center>\n  <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/All_rights_reserved\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/素材授權-保留所有權利-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"素材授權 (保留所有權利)\"></a>\n  \n  <a href=\"https://github.com/KreloX/Gloves-For-All/blob/1.20.1/LICENSE.txt\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/程式碼授權-LGPL%20v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"程式碼授權 (LGPL v3.0)\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<center>\n  <a href='https://moddex.gg/mod/aether-gloves-for-all'><img src='https://moddex.gg/badges/projects/aether-gloves-for-all/rating.svg?style=devin' alt='ModDex 評分'>\n  </a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<h2><center>🥊 關於本擴充模組 🥊</center></h2>\n  \n<p>\n「手套通用（Gloves For All）」擴充模組為其他精選模組的材料引入了手套變體。\n手套可透過合成或與其他相對應的護甲部件相同的方式取得。\n任何套裝完整效果現在也需要裝備手套才能觸發（除非在「天境（The Aether）」的伺服器設定中停用）。\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  若要與「暮光森林（Twilight Forest）」相容，請使用\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/umbral-skies\">Umbral Skies</a>\n</p>\n\n<h3>支援以下模組：</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/caverns-and-chasms\">Caverns & Chasms</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/savage-and-ravage\">Savage & Ravage</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/oreganized\">Oreganized</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/galosphere\">Galosphere</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/addadd\">Additional Additions</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/simpleores\">SimpleOres</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-undergarden\">The Undergarden</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/blue-skies\">Blue Skies</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidscape\">Voidscape</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/the-midnight\">The Midnight</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deeperdarker\">Deeper and Darker</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/botania\">Botania</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\">Create</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/redstone-arsenal\">Redstone Arsenal</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tools-complement\">Tool's Complement</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-cultivation\">Thermal Cultivation</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-innovation\">Thermal Innovation</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/thermal-extra\">Thermal Extra</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/mekanism-tools\">Mekanism Tools</a></li>\n  <li><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ice-and-fire-dragons\">Ice and Fire</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<center>\n  <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a37bc7ff0ce5bc39482171cc41d9c1825b7ad76e.png\">\n</center>\n\n<br>\n<h2><center>☁️ 作者聲明 ☁️</center></h2>\n\n<p>\n「手套通用」是由 KreloX 開發的非官方擴充模組，與天境團隊（The Aether Team）無關。\n</p>\n\n<center>\n  <a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/kreloxkinetic\">\n    <img src=\"https://1drv.ms/i/c/6bf544900f9867ae/IQR3yxNMtle9S4RxniPeeGgMAVrcnQ4U65DGA1uiSdBUIbE?width=837&height=80\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\" />\n  </a>\n</center>",
